duct of 541 and 715, we break down the multiplication using the standard algorithm:\n\n1. **Multiply 541 by the ones place digit (5) of 715:**\n   \\[\n   541 \\times 5 = 2705\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 541 by the tens place digit (10) of 715:**\n   \\[\n   541 \\times 10 = 5410\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 541 by the hundreds place digit (700) of 715:**\n   \\[\n   541 \\times 700 = 378700\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the partial products:\n\\[\n2705 + 5410 + 378700\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the first two partial products:\n\\[\n2705 + 5410 = 8115\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to the third partial product:\n\\[\n8115 + 378700 = 386815\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 541 and 715 is \\(\\boxed{386815}\\).",
