rtial products:**\n\\[\n1494 + 44820 + 298800\n\\]\n\n- First, add \\(1494\\) and \\(44820\\):\n  \\[\n  1494 + 44820 = 46314\n  \\]\n\n- Then add the result to \\(298800\\):\n  \\[\n  46314 + 298800 = 345114\n  \\]\n\nThus, the product of 498 and 693 is \\(\\boxed{345114}\\).", '']
