0+10)*600 = 300*600 +10*600 = 180,000 +6,000 = 186,000. That checks out.\n\nNow I need to add up all three results: 2170 (from the ones place), 24,800 (from the tens place), and 186,000 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 2170 + 24,800. Adding those gives 26,970. Then adding 186,000 to that. 26,970 + 186,000 equals</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
