nd 4230:\n\\[\n846 + 4230 = 5076\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to 84600:\n\\[\n5076 + 84600 = 89676\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 141 and 636 is \\(\\boxed{89676}\\).",
