e 900 -6 =894). 242 ×6 is 1,452. So 217,800 -1,452 = 216,348. Yep, same result. Okay, so that's solid. So the answer is correct.\n\nSo putting it all together, following the template:\n\nThe product of 242 and 894 is calculated by breaking down 894 into 800, 90, and 4. Multiplying each by 242:\n\n1. 242 × 4 = 968\n\n2. 242 × 90 = 21,780\n\n3. 242 × 800 = 193,600\n\nAdding these results: 968 + 21,780 = 22,748; then 22,748 + 193,600 = 216,348.\n\nSo the final answer is 216,348.\n\n</think>", '']
