): 2,565\n\nStep 2: Multiply 855 by 80 (tens place): 68,400\n\nStep 3: Multiply 855 by 400 (hundreds place): 342,000\n\nSumming these gives 2,565 + 68,400 = 70,965; then 70,965 + 342,000 = 412,965.\n\nSo the final answer should be 412,965. I think that's solid.\n</think>\n\n",
