 by the hundreds place digit (800):  \n   \\( 748 \\times 800 = 598,\\!400 \\).  \n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results: \\( 5,\\!236 + 67,\\!320 + 598,\\!400 = 670,\\!956 \\).  \nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{670956}.", '']
