product of 664 and 888, we break down 888 into its place values: 800, 80, and 8. We then multiply each part by 664 and sum the results.\n\n1. Multiply 664 by 8 (ones place):\n   \\[\n   664 \\times 8 = 5312\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 664 by 80 (tens place):\n   \\[\n   664 \\times 80 = 53120\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 664 by 800 (hundreds place):\n   \\[\n   664 \\times 800 = 531200\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these multiplications:\n\\[\n5312 + 53120 + 531200 = 589632\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 664 and 888 is \\(\\boxed{589632}\\).", '']
