 adds two zeros. So 980×600 = 588,000.\n\nNow, I need to add all three results together. Let me write them down:.\n\nFirst step: 980  .\nSecond step: 58,800  .\nThird step: 588,000  .\n\nAdding them up. Let's start with the first two: 980 + 58,800. That should be 59,780. Then add that to 588,000. Hmm, 588,000 plus 59,780</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
