\n+ 5660 (from 10) .\n\n+ 113200 (from 200) .\n\nLet me add the first two first: 2264 + 5660. 2000 + 5000 is 7000, 264 + 660 is 924. So total is 7924. Then add 113200. .\n\n7924 + 113200. Let's see, 7924 + 100000 = 107924, then +13200 more</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
