swer is 368,720.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 440 and 838 is \\boxed{368720}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 440 and 838, we break down the multiplication step by step:\n\n1. **Multiply 440 by the ones place digit (8) of 838:**\n   \\[\n   440 \\times 8 = 3520\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 440 by the tens place digit (30) of 838:**\n   \\[\n   440 \\times 30 = 13200\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 440 by the hundreds place digit (800) of 838:**\n   \\[\n   440 \\times 800 = 352000\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these three steps:\n\\[\n3520 + 13200 + 352000\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the results of the ones and tens place multiplications:\n\\[\n3520 + 13200 = 16720\n\\]\n\nThen, add this result to the hundreds place multiplication:\n\\[\n16720 + 352000 = 368720\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 440 and 838 is \\(\\boxed{368720}\\).", '']
