3=1,062. So 3,540 +1,062=4,602.\n\nSo 177,000 -4,602 = 172,398. Yes! So same answer. So that confirms it.\n\nTherefore, the product is 172,398.\n\nBut let me check once more step by step using another method. Let's do the multiplication vertically:\n\n\u2003\u2003354\n\n×\xa0487\n\n--------\n\nFirst multiply by 7:\n\n354 ×7:\n\n4×7=28, write 8, carryover 2\n\n5×7=35 +2=37, write 7, carryover 3\n\n3×7=21 +3=24, write 24. So 2478.\n\nNext, multiply by 8 (tens place):\n\n354 ×8:\n\n4×8=32, write 2, carryover 3\n\n5×8=40 +3=43, write 3, carryover4\n\n3×8=24 +4=28, write 28. So that gives 2832. But since it's the tens place, shift one to the left: 28320.\n\nThird, multiply by 4 (hundreds place):\n\n354 ×4:\n\n4×4=16, write 6 carryover 1\n\n5×4=20 +1=21, write 1 carryover2\n\n3×4=12 +2=14, write 14. So 1416. Since it's hundreds place, shift two to the left: 141600.\n\nNow add them:\n\n2478\n\n28320\n\n141600\n\nAdding 2478 +28320 = 30798\n\n30798 +141600 = 172,398. Yes, same result.\n\nSo I think that's correct. Maybe I was just overchecking, but better safe than sorry. I don't see any errors in the steps. So the final answer should be 172,398.\n</think>", '']
