dreds place digit 600 of 636:\n   \\[\n   328 \\times 600 = 196800\n   \\]\n\nAnswer:\nNow, sum all the step results:\n\\[\n1968 + 9840 + 196800 = 208608\n\\]\nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{208608}.",
