rst was 1,006, then 30,180, and then 352,100. Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 1,006 + 30,180. Adding those gives 31,186. Then add 352,100 to that. Let me see, 31,186 + 352,100. Adding the thousands: 31,000 + 352,000 = 383,000. Then the remaining 186: 383,000 + 186 = 383,186. Wait, but that doesn't seem right. Wait, maybe I made a mistake here. Let me check again. .\n\nWait, 31,186 + 352,100. Let's line them up properly:.\n\n  31,186.\n+352,100.\n--------</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
