y 802 by the hundreds place digit (300) of 321:**\n   \\[\n   802 \\times 300 = 240600\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the partial products:\n\\[\n802 + 16040 + 240600\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the first two results:\n\\[\n802 + 16040 = 16842\n\\]\n\nThen add the third result:\n\\[\n16842 + 240600 = 257442\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{257442}\\).",
