tion step by step:\n\n1. **Multiply 238 by the ones place digit (3):**\n   \\[\n   238 \\times 3 = 714\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 238 by the tens place digit (90):**\n   \\[\n   238 \\times 90 = 238 \\times 9 \\times 10 = 2142 \\times 10 = 21420\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 238 by the hundreds place digit (600):**\n   \\[\n   238 \\times 600 = 238 \\times 6 \\times 100 = 1428 \\times 100 = 142800\n   \\]\n\n**Summing all the results:**\n\\[\n714 + 21420 + 142800 = 164934\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 238 and 693 is \\(\\boxed{164934}\\).",
