40=3240 +48=3288. Then multiply by 100, so 3288*100 = 328,800. .\n\nNow, sum all three steps: 3836 + 0 + 328,800. Let me add them. .\n\n3836 + 328,800. Let\'s see: 328,800 + 3,000 is 331,800, then subtract the 167 over? Wait no, wait. Wait, 3836 is 3,836. So 328,800 + 3,836. Let\'s do it step by step:.\n\n328,800 + 3,000 = 331,800</think>\nTherefore, the answer is ']]
