ation into steps based on the digits of 282:\n\n1. Multiply 310 by the ones place digit (2):\n   \\[\n   310 \\times 2 = 620\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 310 by the tens place digit (80):\n   \\[\n   310 \\times 80 = 24,800\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 310 by the hundreds place digit (200):\n   \\[\n   310 \\times 200 = 62,000\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these multiplications:\n\\[\n620 + 24,800 + 62,000\n\\]\n\nFirst, add 62,000 and 24,800:\n\\[\n62,000 + 24,800 = 86,800\n\\]\n\nThen add the result to 620:\n\\[\n86,800 + 620 = 87,420\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 310 and 282 is \\(\\boxed{87420}\\).", '']
