0b2 + 650*(3+1) + 1*3. Wait, no, better to expand properly:\n\n(a + b)(a + c) = a\u00b2 + a(b + c) + bc. Here a=650, b=1, c=3. So:\n\n650\u00b2 + 650*(4) + 3*1 = 422,500 + 2,600 + 3 = 422,500 + 2,600 is 425,100 plus 3 is 425,103. Yep, that also works. So that's a third method confirming the same result. Definitely, the answer is 425,103.\n\nSo I think that's the correct product. All different methods lead to the same number, so I'm confident.\n</think>\n\n",
