4 \\times 400 = 684 \\times 4 \\times 100 = 2736 \\times 100 = 273600\n   \\]\n\n**Summing all the partial products:**\n\\[\n4104 + 54720 + 273600\n\\]\n\nFirst, add \\(4104\\) and \\(54720\\):\n\\[\n4104 + 54720 = 58824\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to \\(273600\\):\n\\[\n58824 + 273600 = 332424\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 684 and 486 is \\(\\boxed{332424}\\).",
