 it's 500. So, 140 multiplied by 500. Let me compute that. 140 times 5 is 700, so 140 times 500 would be 700*100 = 70,000. Wait, let me verify that again. 140 * 500 is the same as 140 * 5 * 100. 140*5 is 700, so 700*100 is indeed 70,000. That checks out.\n\nNow, adding up all those three results: 840 (from the ones place) plus 1400 (from the tens place) plus 70,000 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. First, 840 + 1400. 840 + 1400 is 2240</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
