account for the hundreds place: \\(1930 \\times 100 = 193000\\)\n\n4. **Sum all the results:**\n   \\[\n   7720 + 57900 + 193000 = 258620\n   \\]\n   - Step-by-step addition:\n     - \\(7720 + 57900 = 65620\\)\n     - \\(65620 + 193000 = 258620\\)\n\nThus, the final computed product of 965 and 268 is \\(\\boxed{258620}\\).",
