k the multiplication into three steps.\n1. Multiply 646 by the ones place digit (8) of 518:\n   \\[\n   646 \\times 8 = 5168\n   \\]\n2. Multiply 646 by the tens place digit (10) of 518:\n   \\[\n   646 \\times 10 = 6460\n   \\]\n3. Multiply 646 by the hundreds place digit (500) of 518:\n   \\[\n   646 \\times 500 = 323000\n   \\]\n\nNow, sum all the step results:\n\\[\n5168 + 6460 + 323000 = 334628\n\\]\n\nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{334628}.\n# Answer:\nThe product of 646 and 518 is \\boxed{334628}.", '']
