s place digit (9):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 9 = 1953\n   \\]\n   - Calculation: \\(200 \\times 9 = 1800\\) and \\(17 \\times 9 = 153\\), then \\(1800 + 153 = 1953\\).\n\n2. **Multiply 217 by the tens place digit (20):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 20 = 4340\n   \\]\n   - Calculation: \\(217 \\times 2 = 434\\), then add a zero to get \\(4340\\).\n\n3. **Multiply 217 by the hundreds place digit (700):**\n   \\[\n   217 \\times 700 = 151900\n   \\]\n   - Calculation: \\(217 \\times 7 = 1519\\), then add two zeros to get \\(151900\\).\n\n**Summing all the results:**\n\\[\n1953 + 4340 + 151900 = 158193\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 217 and 729 is \\(\\boxed{158193}\\).",
