hose gives 80,000 + 2,400 = 82,400. Alternatively, 206*4 = 824, then add two zeros for the 400, so 82,400. Yep, that checks out.\n\nNow I need to add all three results together: 1648 (from the ones place) + 4120 (from the tens place) + 82,400 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, add 1648 and 4120. 1648 + 4000 is 5648, then plus 120 is 5768. Wait, actually, maybe better to line them up:.\n\n  1648.\n+4120.\n------.\n 5768.\n\nYes, that's right. Then add that to 82,400:.\n\n  5768.\n+82400.\n--------</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
