imes 600 = 896 \\times 6 \\times 100 = 5376 \\times 100 = 537600\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these three multiplications:\n\\[\n4480 + 44800 + 537600\n\\]\n\nAdding step-by-step:\n\\[\n4480 + 44800 = 49280\n\\]\n\\[\n49280 + 537600 = 586880\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product of 896 and 655 is \\(\\boxed{586880}\\).",
