. So I'm confident that 521,252 is the correct product.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 604 and 863 is \\boxed{521252}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 604 and 863, we break down the multiplication into steps based on the digits of 863:\n\n1. Multiply 604 by the ones place digit (3):\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 3 = 1812\n   \\]\n\n2. Multiply 604 by the tens place digit (60):\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 60 = 36240\n   \\]\n\n3. Multiply 604 by the hundreds place digit (800):\n   \\[\n   604 \\times 800 = 483200\n   \\]\n\nNext, we sum the results of these three steps:\n\\[\n1812 + 36240 + 483200\n\\]\n\nFirst, add 1812 and 36240:\n\\[\n1812 + 36240 = 38052\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to 483200:\n\\[\n38052 + 483200 = 521252\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 604 and 863 is \\(\\boxed{521252}\\).", '']
