2:\n   \\[\n   176 \\times 2 = 352\n   \\]\n2. Multiply 176 by the tens place digit (20) of 122:\n   \\[\n   176 \\times 20 = 3520\n   \\]\n3. Multiply 176 by the hundreds place digit (100) of 122:\n   \\[\n   176 \\times 100 = 17600\n   \\]\n\nNow, sum all the step results:\n\\[\n352 + 3520 + 17600 = 21472\n\\]\n\nSo, the final computed product is \\boxed{21472}.",
