tiplication into three steps:\n1. Multiply 772 by the ones place digit (3):  \n   \\( 772 \\times 3 = 2,\\!316 \\).\n2. Multiply 772 by the tens place digit (50):  \n   \\( 772 \\times 50 = 38,\\!600 \\).\n3. Multiply 772 by the hundreds place digit (500):  \n   \\( 772 \\times 500 = 386,\\!000 \\).\n\nNow, sum all the step results:  \n\\( 2,\\!316 + 38,\\!600 + 386,\\!000 = 426,\\!916 \\).\n\nSo, the final computed product is **426,916**.  \nAnswer: \\boxed{426916}", '']
