 607 by 9: 5,463\n\nThen multiply 607 by 70 (shift one position to the left):\n\n607 ×7=4,249 → 42,490\n\nThen multiply 607 by 800 (shift two positions left):\n\n607 ×8=4,856 →485,600\n\nAdd them all: 5,463 +42,490 = 47,953; 47,953 +485,600=533,553. So that's correct.\n\nHmm, so the final answer should be 533,553. Let me just confirm with a calculator approach.\n\n607 ×879. Let me compute 600×800=480,000; 600×70=42,000; 600×9=5,400; 7×800=5,600; 7×70=490; 7×9=63. Adding all these:\n\n480,000 +42,000=522,000; +5,400=527,400; +5,600=533,000; +490=533,490; +63=533,553. Yes! That matches. So I think that's right. \n\nTherefore, the product of 607 and 879 is 533,553.\n</think>", '']
