rt was 0, the tens place part was 57,760, and the hundreds place part was 577,600. Adding those: 57,760 + 577,600. Let me do that addition. .\n\nFirst, adding 57,760 and 577,600. Let's see, 57,760 + 577,600. Maybe align them properly:.\n\n577,600.\n+  57,760.\n----------.\n?.\n\nStarting from the right: 0 +0 is 0. 0 +6 is 6. 6 +7 is 13, carry over 1. 7 +5 is 12 plus the 1 is 13, carry over 1. 5 (from 577,600) plus nothing plus the 1 is 6. Wait, maybe I should write it out:.\n\n577,600.\n+  57,760</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
