y 406 by the hundreds place digit 500 of 543:  \n   \\(406 \\times 500 = 203,\\!000\\).  \n\nAnswer:  \nNow, sum all the step results:  \n\\(1,\\!218 + 16,\\!240 + 203,\\!000 = 220,\\!458\\).  \nSo, the final computed product is **220,458**.",
