 correct.\n\nNow I need to add all three results together:.\n\nFirst step: 5,769.\n\nSecond step:25,640.\n\nThird step:320,500.\n\nAdding them step by step. Let's add the first two first: 5,769 +25,640. .\n\n5,000 +25,000 =30,000. Then 769 +640 = 1,409. So total so far is 30,000 +1,409 =31,409. .\n\nNow add that to 320,500. 31,409 +320,500</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
