s of the first two steps:\n\\[\n936 + 18720 = 19656\n\\]\n\nThen, add the result to the third step:\n\\[\n19656 + 93600 = 113256\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 936 and 121 is \\(\\boxed{113256}\\).", '']
